2786+ 6A89              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2787+ 6A89              ; search_by_Busy_dir
2788+ 6A89              ; Bank-safe replacement used by FIND for names returned by get_item_name.
2789+ 6A89              ; IN:  HL = physical name start, BC = 16-bit name length
2790+ 6A89              ;      item_name_page = bank companion for HL
2791+ 6A89              ; Pattern remains INPBUFF, pattern length is the value patched into txtlen+1.
2792+ 6A89              ; OUT: Z=pattern found, NZ=not found
2793+ 6A89              ; One-character input matches only the FIRST character of a name (quick jump).
2794+ 6A89              ; Two or more characters use normal case-insensitive substring search. There is
2795+ 6A89              ; no 255-byte directory-name limit; directory page crossings are transparent.
2796+ 6A89              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2797+ 6A89              ; --- DOKUMENTACE CZ: search_by_Busy_dir ---
2798+ 6A89              ; Ucel: Vyhledá vzor ve jménu; zvolí rychlou nebo stránkovanou variantu.
2799+ 6A89              ; Vstup: HL = jméno, BC = délka, item_name_page = banka; INPBUFF = malá písmena vzoru, txtlen+1
2800+ 6A89              ;   = délka vzoru.
2801+ 6A89              ; Vystup: Z = shoda, NZ = nenalezeno.
2802+ 6A89              ; Meni: AF, BC, DE, HL, BC'; IX a IY zachovány.
2803+ 6A89              ; Poznamka: Jednoznakový vzor porovnává jen začátek jména; může změnit mapování RAM.
2804+ 6A89              ; --- KONEC DOKUMENTACE CZ ---
2805+ 6A89              search_by_Busy_dir:
2806+ 6A89                      ; Empty name cannot contain a non-empty search pattern.
2807+ 6A89 78                   ld      a,b
2808+ 6A8A B1                   or      c
2809+ 6A8B 28 2A                jr      z,.dir_search_not_found_fast
