8579+ 826A              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
8580+ 826A              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
8581+ 826A              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
8582+ 826A              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
